.ConstantSpells]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"constant-spells","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!irkHE66bHBNsTlyx.v8QaZXPq7Yj9K2v1"},{"_id":"hPc0H3LlS5oAeiST","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Frightful Presence","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>90 feet. @Check[will|dc:42|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":90,"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":["emotion","fear","mental"]}],"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!irkHE66bHBNsTlyx.hPc0H3LlS5oAeiST"},{"_id":"b9ku7PIEzSu9iFAq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Breath Weapon","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The construct breathes in one of two ways, then can't use Breath Weapon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breath Weapon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p>- Flame (arcane, evocation, fire) A blast of flame deals @Damage[15d10[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a @Template[cone|distance:60] (@Check[reflex|dc:45|basic|options:area-effect] save). This fire damage does not harm objects or constructs.</p>\n<p>- Weakening Gas (arcane, necromancy) A cloud of gold-flecked gas forces each creature in a @Template[cone|distance:60] to attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:45] save; the effect lasts 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 5}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 8}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","fire"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!irkHE66bHBNsTlyx.b9ku7PIEzSu9iFAq"},{"_id":"DyilSr4hYYAgoPFF","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reverberating Revenge","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dragonshard guardian takes cold, fire, electricity, or sonic damage from a non-dragonshard guardian source</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragonshard guardian's body absorbs the energy entirely, preventing the damage from harming the construct. Its body reverberates and transforms the absorbed energy before projecting it outward in a @Template[burst|distance:60].</p>\n<p>Each creature within the burst takes an amount of fire damage equal to the amount of energy damage absorbed by the triggering attack, including any damage resisted by the guardian's resistances and additional damage from its weakness (@Check[reflex|dc:45|basic] save).</p>\n<p>This fire damage doesn't harm objects or constructs.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"exceptions":[{"definition":["damage:type:bludgeoning",{"or":["damage:material:adamantine","damage:material:keep-stone"]}],"label":"PF2E.IWR.Custom.AdamantineBludgeoning"}],"key":"Resistance","type":"physical","value":24}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","fire"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!irkHE66bHBNsTlyx.DyilSr4hYYAgoPFF"}],"name":"Dragonshard Guardian","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":-5},"con":{"mod":9},"dex":{"mod":8},"int":{"mod":-5},"str":{"mod":10},"wis":{"mod":7}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":48},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":430,"temp":0,"value":430},"immunities":[{"type":"mental"}],"resistances":[{"type":"fire","value":24}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[],"value":30},"weaknesses":[{"type":"sonic","value":24}]},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":22},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Created by Mengkare and powered by a shard of the <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.L8OButuVM3PFxgrZ]{Orb of Gold Dragonkind}</em>, this construct is made of sculpted crystal draped in a beautiful gold filigree frame.</p>","publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder #150: Broken Promises"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":39,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"precise","range":60,"type":"truesight"}]},"resources":{"focus":{"max":1,"value":1}},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":39},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":36},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":33}},"skills":{"arcana":{"base":30}},"traits":{"rarity":"unique","size":{"value":"lg"},"value":["construct"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium